<title>USA: Omaha hogs $1.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $1.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.50</p>
<p>higher. Top $60.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US  1-3    220-260 lbs    60.50</p>
<p>US  2-3    260-280 lbs    59.50-60.00</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent. 1.50-2.00 higher. Top 49.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-500 lbs    47.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-650 lbs    49.00-49.50</p>
</text>
